## Canonical Files (project-local)

Edits to any of the following affect every contributor working on this project. Do not edit casually.

- `.homebase/project.yml` — registry source of truth (apps, brands, roadmap config).
- `.claude/settings.json` — symlinked to homebase canonical settings; do not hand-edit. Project overlays go in `.claude/settings.local.json`.
- `Documentation/ISSUE_CONVENTIONS.md` — concrete scope prefixes and label taxonomy (per @~/code/homebase/governance/ISSUE_CONVENTIONS_SKELETON.md).
- `recurring-tasks.json` — scheduled audits / reviews owned at the project level.
- {{ADDITIONAL_PROJECT_LOCAL_CANONICAL_FILES}}

## Using Homebase in This Project

1. From homebase root: `bin/homebase link-project {{PROJECT_PATH}}` (idempotent).
2. Verify: `bin/homebase status {{PROJECT_PATH}}` — expect every symlink listed.
3. Fill `{{PROJECT_PATH}}/.homebase/project.yml`, then re-run `bin/homebase index` from homebase to refresh `registry/PROJECTS.md`.

